SUMMARY:Quantitative approximation of the Vlasov-Navier-Stokes system
DESCRIPTION:In this talk\, we will consider a fluid-particle system describing the motion of kinetic particles in a fluid. Such a model arises naturally in the study of aerosols\, sprays\, and more generally two-phase flows. The fluid is modelled by the incompressible Navier-Stokes equations\, whilst $N$ stochastic particles interact with the fluid via the Stokes drag force. As the number of particles $N$ tends t\nhttps://indico.math.cnrs.fr/event/15377/
LOCATION:ICJ
